# xxx Troubleshooting agent xxx


The troubleshooting agent can help with diagnosing live performance and delivery issues for a selected package or placement in Adobe Advertising DSP, and only for package 353301 in this conversation. That includes things like: not spending or low spend, pacing concerns (under/overpacing), auction/delivery issues (low bids, low win rate, no impressions), and performance problems (e.g., CPA/ROAS/CTR/CVR changes) when they're framed as issues to investigate. I cannot change settings, create or edit campaigns/placements/ads, or walk through how to configure the platform. I also cannot answer general educational/how-to questions that are not tied to diagnosing a concrete performance or delivery problem.

